"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"cW2jouXxw1XFN8t35hnrDA","review_id":"xtraIDspG8AcXKo-PxHsug","date":"2017-08-26T23:59:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9377769827842712,"text_excerpt":"Love this place! A hole in the wall on berhman highway. Has a mix of vietnamese bread & coffee and french baked goods. My favorite banh mi are the xiu mai (meatball) and dac biet (combination). Their banh mi is bigger than your average banh mi you can find anywhere else. The iced coffee is a little too sweet for my liking but still good! Inexpensive & tasty! Recommend 10/10"},{"business_id":"cW2jouXxw1XFN8t35hnrDA","review_id":"GvKXgw-egfJD1EYJe59TZg","date":"2019-08-24T04:53:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9280587434768677,"text_excerpt":"So this time, I finally tried out their Banh Mi. I got the #1-which is the combination meats one. The bread was more a french baguette style versus the other type of Banh Mi bread.I suggest buying a few loaves to bring home for sandwiches. They have so many types of Banh Mi. It definitely worth a try."},{"business_id":"cW2jouXxw1XFN8t35hnrDA","review_id":"pm1DUnQsokSJEPEIW-7sEA","date":"2017-11-19T21:25:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9260591268539429,"text_excerpt":"Sweet little shop. Great customer service, very friendly! I picked up Cafe Sua Da aka Vietnamese French coffee, very good! Fastly made, thank goodness. I also ordered Pate Chaud; 1 chicken and 1 pork, a buttered croissant, and their Dejepe special sandwich (cold cuts, but no headcheese, which I like, but it's ok). EVERYTHING was delicious! I love the homemade baguette they use, it's the best I've had for this type of sandwich. I couldn't finish the sandwich in one sitting, but when I came back to finish it, the baguette was still fresh tasting! Wth o_O. Good portions. It smells so good in this shop! Everything is homemade and fresh. It's now my spot to pick up Vietnamese sandwiches & bake..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"cW2jouXxw1XFN8t35hnrDA","photo_id":"8_8VK0GK-WiJengvEgslfA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/8_8VK0GK-WiJengvEgslfA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8786520957946777},{"business_id":"cW2jouXxw1XFN8t35hnrDA","photo_id":"Y_ZGKIl4PYsnfQbR9lB6EQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Y_ZGKIl4PYsnfQbR9lB6EQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8763620257377625},{"business_id":"cW2jouXxw1XFN8t35hnrDA","photo_id":"hLLK7NC13itVkbDCOKl63g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/hLLK7NC13itVkbDCOKl63g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8420920372009277},{"business_id":"cW2jouXxw1XFN8t35hnrDA","photo_id":"6vxjCbg1C0E_sr9fF0zQtA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/6vxjCbg1C0E_sr9fF0zQtA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8383135795593262},{"business_id":"cW2jouXxw1XFN8t35hnrDA","photo_id":"Q7chytgYb1UZaZw7Yx80ew","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Q7chytgYb1UZaZw7Yx80ew.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8288816809654236}]},"notebook_case":null}
